  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mitigation Measures to Support Inclusive Devand Transition in India towards Net Zero Future</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a preparatory project to scale up decenrtalized renewable energy technology systems for livelihood of poor and vulnerable households in remote rural areas. this PIP will also support the development of a National Climate Forum that will further support development of the ecosystem for DRE for livelihoods in these regions.</narrative>
  </description>
